WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:54.090
<b>The Honorable Captain T-Bone</b>

3
00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:53.470
[ROBIN]
What's going on?

4
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.600
How did you get here in the first place?

5
00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:58.970
This is dangerous, you know!

6
00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:01.280
What are you?

7
00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:02.620
[SOGEKING]
Pleased to meet you.

8
00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:05.520
I'm Sniper King,
the King of the Snipers.

9
00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:08.530
To make a long story short,
I've come to rescue you.

10
00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:09.530
You're really serious.

11
00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:11.300
I am not alone, of course.

12
00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:14.200
Your friend Sanji and a
cyborg thug named Franky,

13
00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:17.140
are currently engaged
in battle on this train.

14
00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:20.340
They kept the enemy busy long enough for me to come here.

15
00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:22.380
Furthermore,
Captain Luffy and the rest

16
00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.880
of the Straw Hats are following
closely on another Sea Train.

17
00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:28.280
I hear he's bringing a small army with him.

18
00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:35.930
On my way here, I peeked inside the other train cars.

19
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.870
Frankly, I believe
the four agents in

20
00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.640
the car behind us may
prove too great a challenge.

21
00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:43.170
If possible,
I would like to escape

22
00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:45.610
with you before
Sanji has to face them.

23
00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:55.650
Come, let's run away together!

24
00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.830
What's the matter?

25
00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:04.750
There's no need to worry.

26
00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.940
I made all of the
necessary preparations.

27
00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.260
Here.

28
00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.060
These Octopu-shoes are for you.

29
00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.850
If you use them on
your hands and feet,

30
00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:13.820
you can climb through the window

31
00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:16.080
and stick to the outer
panels of the sea train.

32
00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:18.510
Quickly put them
on before they notice.

33
00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.950
[ROBIN]
I won't go.

34
00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:21.950
Why not?

35
00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.890
I don't know why you're doing this.

36
00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:28.220
I told you very clearly that I wouldn't see you again.

37
00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:30.480
I said I would never
return to the Straw Hats!

38
00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.350
The situation has changed.

39
00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:40.790
They know why you turned yourself in.

40
00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.870
That Ice gentleman from the
shipyard clarified everything.

41
00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.170
So he survived after all.

42
00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:52.760
But still, that doesn't change my mind.

43
00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.000
I won't go with you,
no matter what.

44
00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.100
[SOGEKING]
Enough with that already!

45
00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.230
Don't you get it?

46
00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.760
They aren't so weak that
you need to worry about them!

47
00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.110
What were you thinking,
accepting such a stupid deal

48
00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.340
before talking to
the rest of the crew?!

49
00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.080
You think they'd
be happy to go on,

50
00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.900
knowing that
one of their friends

51
00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.200
had thrown her
life away for them?

52
00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.960
Now that they know why you left,

53
00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.460
they'll follow you to the
depths of hell if they have to

54
00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:22.420
and they'll bust every skull
they can on the way there!

55
00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:23.580
You don't get it, do you?

56
00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.040
That's the kind of guy Luffy is!

57
00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.580
How many times do
I have to tell you this?!

58
00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:33.050
Even if you think you can save
me, I don't want your help!

59
00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.250
Don't you care how I feel?!

60
00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.390
C'mon, gimme a break!

61
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.300
[CORGY]
Hey, keep it down in there, you!

62
00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.410
What's the matter?

63
00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:48.610
Now that we're getting
closer to Enies Lobby

64
00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:52.920
is that cool exterior of yours
finally starting to melt away?

65
00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:54.880
Well, you can cry all you like

66
00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.020
but there's no point
in lamenting your fate

67
00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:59.390
after it's already been sealed.

68
00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:02.020
Really, I'm fine.

69
00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:04.710
Strange.

70
00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.100
That's not the reaction I was expecting.

71
00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.740
I can't put my finger on it,

72
00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.370
but there's something
different about her.

73
00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:17.600
Maybe it's just my imagination?

74
00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:20.140
I said I'm fine.

75
00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:22.280
Now please, just leave me alone.

76
00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.050
This is definitely fishy!

77
00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.680
Why is she goofing off at a time like this?

78
00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.660
Rabbit Ears?

79
00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:37.940
<b>Sanji vs. Wanze
Car Four</b>

80
00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:35.390
Hey!

81
00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:41.900
I'd like to welcome you to the
wonderful world of Ramen Kenpo!

82
00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:45.090
That is the lamest power-up ever.

83
00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.620
Go, go, go!

84
00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.990
Here I come!

85
00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:51.660
Ramen Kenpo!

86
00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.760
Pork Bone Spank attack!

87
00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:04.610
[SANJI]
That's the same useless punch from before, only bigger.

88
00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:08.710
Go, go, go! Have another!

89
00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:15.750
Dammit! I'm stuck in
this stupid thing!

90
00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:25.390
Go, go, go, go!

91
00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:34.510
Go, go, go, go, go!
So, what do you think?

92
00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:38.080
My Ramen Kenpo attacks are
pretty impressive, aren't they?

93
00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:40.590
It's kind of hard to
look cool when your arm

94
00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.560
and leg are buried
in noodles like that.

95
00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.730
And now I believe it's
time to pay you back

96
00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:49.130
for all those kicks
you gave me earlier!

97
00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.330
What?

98
00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:59.840
What the hell are you
getting dizzy for, you idiot?!

99
00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:02.070
You were trying to make me woozy

100
00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.810
using your freaky eyebrows
again, weren't you?!

101
00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:06.010
Bad move.

102
00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.680
You're gonna pay for that!

103
00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:13.650
Dammit!

104
00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:16.750
I can't pull my arm or leg out!

105
00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:20.190
It's impossible to
fight back like this!

106
00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:26.520
Here comes my Noodle Soul Press!

107
00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.790
Want some more?

108
00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:35.970
Here's...

109
00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.000
...another helping!

110
00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:41.340
Another helping! Another
helping! Another helping!

111
00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:42.540
Another helping!

112
00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.410
[WANZE]
Take that and that
and that and that

113
00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.680
and that and that
and that and that!

114
00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.010
Finally, I'm free.

115
00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.330
Go, go, go!

116
00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:01.210
That's what you get for
underestimating me, you meanie!

117
00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:05.670
No one stands a chance against
my mad, mad Ramen Kenpo!

118
00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:10.310
If I attack him, I'm gonna get caught in those noodles again.

119
00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.060
I'll just have to avoid that stupid suit of his.

120
00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.130
Go, go, go!

121
00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.580
Have a taste of this!

122
00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.650
Ramen and Gyoza Combo!

123
00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:26.590
Clap-ping!

124
00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.670
And that leaves
me only one place

125
00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:33.160
where I can attack
this annoying clown.

126
00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.930
[SANJI]
Escalope!

127
00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:39.600
Ramen Beam!

128
00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.460
[WANZE]
Go, go, go, go, go, go!

129
00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.660
As you can see, I don't have a weak spot!

130
00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.430
And I've already figured
out your fighting style.

131
00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:01.210
Every one of your attacks
is some form of kicking.

132
00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.680
So if I lock down your
legs, you're finished!

133
00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.560
Go, go, go, go!

134
00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:08.300
Sucks to be you, huh?!

135
00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:09.330
No matter what you do,

136
00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:14.910
you'll still end up
getting stuck in my suit!

137
00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.340
Now, Mr. Wet Noodle,

138
00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.810
while we're at it, try
this one on for size!

139
00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:20.180
Ramen Kenpo!

140
00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:22.350
Multi-Noodle Spank!

141
00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:35.720
What in the heck did you do to my noodles?!

142
00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:45.260
I turned that hunk of
pasta fedelini into a platter.

143
00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.330
Huh?

144
00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:48.830
Some sort of trick?

145
00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:53.400
Hey! You sliced my noodle
fists to shreds, you jerk!

146
00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.220
[SANJI]
A chef must fight without using his hands or knives.

147
00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.420
Those are sacred.

148
00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:02.920
So it's always been my policy
not to use them in battle.

149
00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:06.490
But, since we're in a kitchen

150
00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:08.720
and you're using
food as a weapon.

151
00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:12.220
That changes things
a bit, now doesn't it?

152
00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.050
Well!

153
00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:13.890
I knew you were
a pain in the butt,

154
00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:16.200
but that one really
takes the cake!

155
00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:19.570
Thousand Noodle Whip!

156
00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.210
Trying to look cool,
you insolent little punk?!

157
00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:29.170
Huh?!

158
00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.040
An amateur cook
like you shouldn't

159
00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.810
even touch my
precious kitchen knives!

160
00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:33.380
You hear me?!

161
00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:36.280
Those are meant for
trained professionals only!

162
00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:37.380
See?!

163
00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:40.620
I sincerely apologize for
my insolence in your kitchen.

164
00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.950
But I'm going to let you in
on a little culinary secret.

165
00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:49.960
It's time for a demonstration.

166
00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:53.530
This is how a real chef

167
00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.550
gracefully handles
his kitchen knives.

168
00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:02.560
<b>Franky vs. Nero
Rooftop, Car Three</b>

169
00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.580
Shave!

170
00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:10.150
Strong Hammer!

171
00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:12.250
Paper Art.

172
00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.060
[NERO]
Tempest Kick!

173
00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:29.670
[FRANKY]
How about a taste of Fresh Fire?

174
00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.280
Has this guy lost his mind?

175
00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.310
He jumped out over the sea!

176
00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:38.540
[NERO]
Moon Walk!

177
00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:45.620
[FRANKY]
How in the hell did this freak
jump back in mid-air like that?

178
00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:49.560
[NERO]
Why doesn't my Tempest Kick
have any effect on him?

179
00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.830
There's something
strange about his body.

180
00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.640
I've had enough of you!

181
00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:56.270
Likewise!

182
00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.620
What the hell are you?!

183
00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:10.660
[LUFFY]
Are we there yet?

184
00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:11.600
[NAMI]
Where's Bashing Tom?

185
00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:12.800
It's Puffing Tom!

186
00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.240
Anyway, get inside before you catch a cold!

187
00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.810
You just changed clothes and you're soaking wet already!

188
00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:18.910
[LUFFY]
I don't care.

189
00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:21.320
It's more awesome up here.

190
00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:23.360
[NAMI]
Fine.

191
00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:25.890
[ZAMBAI]
Now, Gum-Gum-

192
00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:28.260
Three Hundred Caliber-Cannon!

193
00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.420
Boom!

194
00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:32.860
[ZORO]
Would all of you stop screwing around?!

195
00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.270
[BOTH]
– We're bored.
– We're bored.

196
00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.180
Then polish your
weapons or something!

197
00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.340
What's wrong with you?!

198
00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.850
[PAULIE]
Uh yeah.

199
00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.250
I tried to tell those guys
the same thing earlier,

200
00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.920
but they wouldn't listen to me.

201
00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:53.230
[LUFFY]
Hey, check it out!

202
00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:55.560
There's a train in front of us!

203
00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.770
[EVERYONE]
– It's the Puffing Tom!
– It's the Puffing Tom!

204
00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:05.770
[KOKORO]
Seems a bit early
don't you think?

205
00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:07.640
Who's in my armpit?!

206
00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:08.780
[OFFICIAL]
Dammit!

207
00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:10.380
What's gonna happen to us now?

208
00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:11.880
There's no engine on this car.

209
00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:14.520
All we can do is wait it out.

210
00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:15.250
Ah!

211
00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:16.350
Another wave!

212
00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:18.920
Whoa, this storm
is still pretty bad.

213
00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.480
You think someone will come save us?

214
00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:23.350
Hey, guys, there's something
approaching from behind!

215
00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:24.020
Really?!

216
00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:25.660
It must be a rescue ship!

217
00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.520
I don't think so.

218
00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:30.030
Actually, it looks like it's coming on the railway.

219
00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.700
There's no way.

220
00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:33.640
There's only one sea
train in the world

221
00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:34.910
and we're on it right now.

222
00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.500
[MARINE]
Besides, it's Aqua Laguna.

223
00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.810
No one could make it out of Water Seven in this weather.

224
00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:41.450
Well, if it's not
a train, then...

225
00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:47.510
...what the heck is it?

226
00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:51.760
That's the Puffing Tom all
right but it's just the caboose.

227
00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.620
There's no engine!

228
00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:55.360
And it doesn't look like it's moving!

229
00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:56.400
That can't be right.

230
00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.300
[TILESTONE]
What's going on here?!

231
00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:01.240
Does this mean it got detached somehow?

232
00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.360
Maybe something happened

233
00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.640
and Sanji and
Usopp are on there!

234
00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.570
[MOZU and KIWI]
– Big Bro Franky, too!
– Big Bro Franky, too!

235
00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:09.940
[PAULIE]
Well, I hope not, cause we're
about to crash into 'em!

236
00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:11.540
Granny, hit the brake!

237
00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.740
I already told you,
now didn't I?

238
00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.380
We don't got one!

239
00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.580
We're gonna crash!

240
00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:20.510
Luffy!

241
00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.150
What are you gonna do?

242
00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:24.580
I'm flying over to see what's up!

243
00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:28.450
Now Gum-Gum Rocket!

244
00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:32.760
There's something in the sky!

245
00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:39.330
What happened?

246
00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.330
Ow, ow, ow.

247
00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:51.230
All right!

248
00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:52.400
I made it!

249
00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:55.370
[MARINE]
Who the hell is this weirdo?!

250
00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:56.320
[LUFFY]
Hello?

251
00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.280
Sanji!

252
00:14:57.400 --> 00:14:58.770
Are you in here?

253
00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.910
Or Usopp?

254
00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:04.680
Hey, Sanji!

255
00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:07.090
You hear me?

256
00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:08.390
Maybe over there.

257
00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:16.100
[OFFICIAL]
Wait a sec.

258
00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:17.230
I know that face!

259
00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.980
[MARINE]
It's Straw Hat Luffy!

260
00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.160
Are you there?

261
00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.850
Sanji?

262
00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:34.890
[EVERYONE panicking]

263
00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:35.380
Shut up!

264
00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:39.590
I can't hear!

265
00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.690
[MARINE]
B-Bring it on!

266
00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.490
We're not scared of you!

267
00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:43.540
Where's Sanji?

268
00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.200
Wait, what?

269
00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.470
I don't know who that is.

270
00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.540
[LUFFY]
Sanji!

271
00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:47.840
He's my friend!

272
00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:49.840
[MARINE]
Sorry, never heard of him!

273
00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.810
Too bad.

274
00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:54.390
See ya.

275
00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.560
[OFFICIAL]
Shoot him!

276
00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.400
[gunshot]
[OFFICIALS clamoring]

277
00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:02.940
[ZAMBAI]
Straw Hat's coming out!

278
00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:08.190
Looks like they're shooting him,
and he's saying "no."

279
00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.120
[LULU]
Well, whatever happened,

280
00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:12.160
the train cars must
be full of Marines.

281
00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:14.500
[KOKORO]
So what's the plan, Rope Man?

282
00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.270
If we don't move
those cars outta the way,

283
00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:17.670
we might get knocked off!

284
00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:27.530
Holy crap, it is a
sea train after all!

285
00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:28.810
[OFFICIAL]
They're gonna ram right into us!

286
00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:30.820
[MARINE]
Yeah and if they
don't slow down soon,

287
00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:33.510
we're gonna get
smashed to pieces!

288
00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:36.010
[ZAMBAI]
Let the Franky
Family handle this!

289
00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:38.450
We'll dismantle 'em
before they can hit us!

290
00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:39.580
[TILESTONE]
Let me help!

291
00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:41.420
I wanna break stuff too!

292
00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:42.150
[ZAMBAI]
Hear that, men?

293
00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:43.960
Get to work!

294
00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.590
[FAMILY MEN]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

295
00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:46.460
Hey!

296
00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:48.460
Zoro!

297
00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:49.720
Hear that, Roronoa?

298
00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.490
He's calling for you!

299
00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.420
Go ahead!

300
00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:55.120
Cut 'em!

301
00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.230
Okay.

302
00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:58.860
[ZAMBAI ET AL.]
– That's it?!
– That's it?!

303
00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:07.840
[OFFICIAL]
Stop the train!

304
00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:12.180
[ZORO]
The ego of the entropic world.

305
00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:16.980
Shall be rent in twain.

306
00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:26.200
Two-Sword Style Sword Draw...

307
00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.410
...Rashomon!

308
00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:05.140
[LULU]
Hey, if you're gonna do
something crazy like that,

309
00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:07.010
you gotta warn us first!

310
00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.880
[LUFFY]
You heard me say
"cut 'em" didn't you?

311
00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:10.440
[LULU]
But I didn't think he could actually do it!

312
00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.140
Of course he could do it!

313
00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:13.980
We'd be dead right
now if he couldn't!

314
00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:16.020
Yeah, I guess that's true

315
00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:18.450
but you're gonna
give me a heart attack!

316
00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:22.790
He's got all that power and he's
not even the leader of the crew?

317
00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:28.360
We're not done yet.

318
00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:29.990
[ZAMBAI]
What the hell is that?!

319
00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:31.140
[TILESTONE]
It's a Sea King!

320
00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:34.090
[ZORO]
There's someone waiting on this railway.

321
00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:38.620
Someone who can cut
Sea Kings in half.

322
00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:50.380
How many times do
I have to tell you this?!

323
00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:53.330
[ZAMBAI]
What the hell is that?!

324
00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.660
What are you talking about?

325
00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:56.450
What the?!

326
00:18:57.890 --> 00:18:58.690
[MARINE]
Damn it!

327
00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.000
That's cheating!

328
00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.300
[OFFICIAL]
You'll pay for this!

329
00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:03.930
[commotion among MARINES]

330
00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.710
I was too late.

331
00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:08.040
[SANJI]
Have a safe trip, gentlemen!

332
00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.460
Say hello to the sea kings for me!

333
00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.880
I must catch the train.

334
00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:19.990
I must rectify my mistake
and capture the prisoners

335
00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:23.320
before their evil is once
again set upon this world!

336
00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:26.300
I cannot allow
the blood and tears

337
00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:29.900
of innocent
civilians to be shed!

338
00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:32.300
I'll show them that
there's justice yet

339
00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.370
in this cruel and
unforgiving world!

340
00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:39.310
I don't care if my body
is torn to shreds

341
00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.540
by these raging waves.

342
00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:41.510
I swear!

343
00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:42.710
No matter the cost,

344
00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:46.150
I'll protect the future of law-abiding citizens everywhere!

345
00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.200
Huh?

346
00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:26.970
No, it can't be!

347
00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:32.540
It seems there's another sea train!

348
00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.950
I see someone.

349
00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:41.720
What the?

350
00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:46.520
Hey, there's a guy out there!

351
00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.310
It's the Ship-Slasher!

352
00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.150
[LULU and TILESTONE]
– That's not good!
– That's not good!

353
00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.320
[LUFFY]
Ship what?

354
00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.520
They call him
"Ship-Slasher" T-Bone.

355
00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:57.830
He's from the Navy.

356
00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.620
His sword cuts
through pirate ships

357
00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.590
like a knife cuts
through a steak!

358
00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:02.690
Whoa!

359
00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:03.890
That sounds awesome.

360
00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:07.230
[ZAMBAI]
Maybe it'd be awesome if it was somebody else's problem!

361
00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:08.900
All right men, let's go!

362
00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:10.040
We only get one shot!

363
00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.940
Set your sights on T-Bone!

364
00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:12.770
You ready?

365
00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.560
[EVERYONE]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

366
00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:19.600
[FAMILY MEN clamoring]

367
00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:23.000
[LUFFY]
Hold on!

368
00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:23.850
[FAMILY MEN]
– Huh?
– Huh?

369
00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:24.580
What?!

370
00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:26.310
We don't have time to hold on...

371
00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:28.550
he's gonna cut
Rocketman in half!

372
00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:30.680
[LUFFY]
Jeez, there's
nothing to worry about!

373
00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.590
Zoro's got this.

374
00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:33.920
Just watch!

375
00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:35.390
I'm only gonna tell you this one time!

376
00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.070
Get the hell out of the way!

377
00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:44.570
[T-BONE]
There's no other track.

378
00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:47.640
I'm sure they passed by my men on the way here.

379
00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:51.290
What did those
monsters do to them?!

380
00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:53.760
They must be
Nico Robin's crewmates.

381
00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:57.330
In that case, that swordsman
is the pirate hunter!

382
00:21:57.360 --> 00:22:02.200
Those who defile this path of justice will face my wrath!

383
00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:06.210
I am a proud Captain of the Navy!

384
00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:08.310
I shall not let you pass!

385
00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:11.710
Be it wood or steel, I'll slash your ship in two!

386
00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:13.810
Good luck with that one.

387
00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:15.880
We won't stop 'til
we reach our goal.

388
00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:19.680
And I'll cut down anything in our way!

389
00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:22.320
[ZORO]
This guy is fierce.

390
00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:26.020
En garde!

391
00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:38.130
[T-BONE]
I hate crooked swordplay.
Right Angle Flying Bird.

392
00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:42.740
[ZORO]
Three-Sword Style Bull Demon!

393
00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:07.530
[T-BONE]
He cut right through it!

394
00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:09.540
[ZORO]
Bold Hooves!

395
00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:28.420
He beat T-Bone!

396
00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:30.860
He must've come from
one of the loose cars.

397
00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:32.300
Gotta hand it to him.

398
00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:35.030
It takes a lot of guts to
keep going in a storm like this.

399
00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:38.300
But still that's not
enough to stop us.

400
00:23:39.970 --> 00:23:42.670
I'm sure the burden
of justice is a heavy one

401
00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:45.640
but we've got a
few burdens of our own.

402
00:23:52.810 --> 00:23:54.240
[MARINE]
Hurry! Hurry!

403
00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:55.810
Captain T-Bone is out here!

404
00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:56.810
He needs our help!

405
00:23:56.840 --> 00:23:59.580
[OFFICIAL]
What if he already got hit by that sea train?

406
00:23:59.610 --> 00:24:01.680
Hey, don't even joke
about something like that,

407
00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:03.550
you bastard... our
captain would cut

408
00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:06.190
that crappy train in
two and you know it!

409
00:24:13.780 --> 00:24:15.280
You think it was Sanji?

410
00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:16.380
[CHOPPER]
Of course!

411
00:24:16.410 --> 00:24:18.980
How else do you think those train cars got detached?

412
00:24:19.010 --> 00:24:20.250
Good strategy, huh?

413
00:24:20.280 --> 00:24:22.210
So you think
we'll catch up soon?

414
00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:23.480
Seems like it.

415
00:24:23.510 --> 00:24:24.610
Yeah!

416
00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:31.890
I'm ready for a fight!

417
00:24:31.920 --> 00:24:33.820
Go, Rocketman!

418
00:24:33.850 --> 00:24:36.590
We're gonna beat up that pigeon guy!
